  change b65x_cpEval (b65x_cpSub b65x_certN_2_2 b65x_certD_2_2) t ≠ 0 at h1
  change b65x_cpEval (b65x_cpAdd b65x_certN_2_2 (b65x_cpScale 2 b65x_certD_2_2)) t ≠ 0 at h2
  rw [b65x_cpEval_sub] at h1
  rw [b65x_cpEval_add, b65x_cpEval_scale] at h2
